OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised about latest
OL,4,ABroads toll increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to increase toll fees on the
OL,7,FBroads have prompted concerns as to
OL,8,Fwhether boaters are getting value for
OL,9,Fmoney.
OL,11,FThe Broads Authority (BA) is proposing
OL,12,Fa 3.5% increase in the amount which
OL,13,Fpeople pay to use the waterways for
OL,14,F2027/28.
OL,16,FThe charges fund maintenance of the
OL,17,FNorfolk and Suffolk Broads managed by
OL,18,Fthe authority but have proved
OL,19,Fcontentious, with the proposal
OL,20,Fpotentially being the sixth consecutive
OL,21,Fannual rise.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
