OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns raised about latest
OL,4,ABroads toll increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Collins, a member of the
OL,7,Fauthority's navigation committee, said:
OL,8,F"I think there is a concern that what
OL,9,Fboat owners are paying for is a
OL,10,Fdeclining resource."
